@startuml sm_007_authorization
' ============================================================
' Title:     SM-007 Capability Authorization
' Source:    docs/spec/contracts/authorization/capabilities.yaml
'            docs/spec/contracts/authorization/role_matrix.yaml
'            docs/spec/contracts/finding_lifecycle/sod_contract.yaml
' C4:        api (ingress gate); denials → finding_events_repository → finding_events_store
'            SoD also at findings_application FSM; ResolveConflict (domain · not peer)
' Package:   rest_interface / CapabilityEnforcer (C4: api)
' Contract:  1.1.0
' ============================================================

title **SM-007 — Capability Authorization**\nC4: api · denials → finding_events_repository → finding_events_store\n<size:12><i>authenticate · capability · SoD · stage · allow | deny+audit</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> RequestReceived : <b>AuthzRequestReceived</b>\nactor: any authenticated or unauthenticated caller\ncommand: any mutating or gated read

state "Request\nReceived" as RequestReceived #B9770E : **entry** raw request at interface\n**allowed** authenticate\n**forbidden** domain mutation
state "Identity\nVerified" as IdentityVerified #1B7A6E : **entry** authenticated actor\nrole bound (RO | CR | System | AI)\n**allowed** matrix lookup\n**forbidden** anonymous dispatch

' ---------- Hierarchical: access evaluation pipeline ----------
state "Evaluate Access" as EvaluateAccess #1B7A6E {
  [*] --> CapabilityEvaluated
  state "Capability\nEvaluated" as CapabilityEvaluated #1B7A6E : **entry** matrix role × capability\n**allowed** PASS → SoD or stage\n**forbidden** implicit grant\nmatrix: Official directive.* · finding.dismiss/waive/\napprove/reject/supersede · conflict.resolve\nCompliance: inspection.* · acknowledge · evidence\nBoth: finding.view · analytics.view (findings read models)
  state "SoD\nEvaluated" as SoDEvaluated #B9770E : **entry** only finding.waive or\nfinding.approve_remediation\n**allowed** SoD-1 creator_provenance\nSoD-2 evidence_submitter\n**forbidden** skip SoD on those actions
  state "Stage Gate\nChecked" as StageGateChecked #1B7A6E : **entry** enforcement point match\n1 ingress · 2 directive write lock\n3 inspection entry · 4 Finding FSM\n5 conflict resolution\n**forbidden** bypass stage
  state "Allowed" as Allowed #2C6E49 : **entry** proceed to domain FSM/pipeline\n**allowed** dispatch command\n**forbidden** skip audit on later deny paths (N/A)

  CapabilityEvaluated --> SoDEvaluated : <b>AuthzSoDRequired</b>\nactor: System\n[actionInSodSet]\naction ∈ {finding.waive, finding.approve_remediation}
  CapabilityEvaluated --> StageGateChecked : <b>AuthzSoDSkipped</b>\nactor: System\n[actionNotInSodSet]
  SoDEvaluated --> StageGateChecked : <b>AuthzSoDPassed</b>\nactor: System\n[waiveImpliesActorNotCreator]\n[approveImpliesActorNotEvidenceSubmitter]
  StageGateChecked --> Allowed : <b>AuthzAllowed</b>\nactor: System
  Allowed --> [*] : <b>AuthzDispatched</b>\nactor: System
}

' ---------- Hierarchical: hard-deny path ----------
state "Deny Path" as DenyPath #A93226 {
  [*] --> Denied
  state "Denied" as Denied #A93226 : **entry** 403 CapabilityDenied\n**allowed** audit only\n**forbidden** partial write · compensating success event\n· degraded-mode · auto-escalation
  state "Denial\nAudited" as DenialAudited #4A4A4A : **entry** append-only denial record\n{actor, capability, action,\noutcome:denied, timestamp, reason}\n**allowed** return error to caller\n**forbidden** mutate domain aggregate
  state "Domain State\nUnchanged" as DomainUnchanged #A93226 : **entry** hard reject complete **terminal**\n**allowed** caller decides next action\n**forbidden** silent retry as success

  Denied --> DenialAudited : <b>AuthzDenialAudited</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: append denial audit
  DenialAudited --> DomainUnchanged : <b>AuthzDomainUnchanged</b>\nactor: System
  DomainUnchanged --> [*] : <b>Finalized</b>\nactor: System
}

RequestReceived --> IdentityVerified : <b>AuthzIdentityVerified</b>\nactor: System (api)\ncommand: bind identity + role
RequestReceived --> DenyPath : <b>AuthzDenied</b>\nactor: System\n/ reasonUnauthenticated()

IdentityVerified --> EvaluateAccess : <b>AuthzCapabilityChecked</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: matrix lookup

' External FAIL exits from evaluation substates into DenyPath
CapabilityEvaluated --> Denied : <b>AuthzDenied</b>\nactor: System\n/ capabilityNotGrantedToRole()
SoDEvaluated --> Denied : <b>AuthzDenied</b>\nactor: System\n/ sodConflict()
StageGateChecked --> Denied : <b>AuthzDenied</b>\nactor: System\n/ stageCapabilityMismatch()

EvaluateAccess --> [*] : <b>AuthzDispatched</b>\nactor: System
DenyPath --> [*] : <b>Finalized</b>\nactor: System

footer SM-007 · Contract 1.1.0 · api · Selma

@enduml
